<title>CANADA: Provigo Q3 Nov 2 profit turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Provigo Q3 Nov 2 profit turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr    Loss	     C$0.17   Profit	C$0.13</p>
<p> Net    Loss	     13,600   Profit	14,200</p>
<p> Revs		   1,355,800		1,327,600</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr    Profit	   C$0.17   Profit	C$0.47</p>
<p> Net    Profit	   21,500   Profit	49,300</p>
<p> Revs		   4,468,400		4,382,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  95,570		   86,670</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: Full name is Provigo Inc. Latest quarter and nine months includes provision for losses of C$29.1 million related to the bankruptcy of Consumers Distributing Inc and settlement with certain LOEB franchises in Ontario. Year earlier quarter and nine months ended November 4.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Montreal bureau (514) 985-2434</p>
